{"publicId":"8ad507ce-b325-436d-bffc-c8c7d89673f6","title":"Moderna与Merck合作癌症疫苗拟提交FDA上市申请","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T16:26:47.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-13T16:26:47.000Z","digest":"Moderna宣布已开始大规模生产与Merck合作的癌症疫苗，并计划向美国食品药品监督管理局（FDA）提交上市申请。根据Endpoints News 2026-11-14报道，该公司位于马萨诸塞州剑桥的生产设施已具备‘按计划推进’能力，目标生产数千剂疫苗。目前尚未披露具体申请时间表或临床数据细节。\n\n该疫苗为Moderna与Merck合作开发的mRNA癌症疫苗，此前双方在2025年已公布III期临床试验部分数据，显示对非小细胞肺癌的客观缓解率为52.3%。但未明确说明该数据是否已纳入当前申请材料。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-13T18:03:22.612Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Moderna 准备向 FDA 提交其与 Merck 合作的癌症疫苗生产申请","latestReport":{"id":"hpyuyu0x2e9wuggrjvi2bettr"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fZQoTknaKQ6A","title":"Moderna准备向FDA提交癌症疫苗上市申请","firstReportAt":"2026-11-13T16:26:47.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"hpyuyu0x2e9wuggrjvi2bettr","title":"Moderna 准备向 FDA 提交其与 Merck 合作的癌症疫苗生产申请","summary":"Moderna 已准备好大规模生产其与 Merck 合作的癌症疫苗，并即将向 FDA 提交市场申请。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T16:26:47.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"hpyuyu0x2e9wuggrjvi2bettr","title":"Moderna 准备向 FDA 提交其与 Merck 合作的癌症疫苗生产申请","summary":"Moderna 已准备好大规模生产其与 Merck 合作的癌症疫苗，并即将向 FDA 提交市场申请。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T16:26:47.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-13T18:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T21:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T04:00:00.000Z","heat":7.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T06:00:00.000Z","heat":6.8,"participants":1},